{"title":"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parabola\" title=\"Parabola\">parabola</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84cea4f7bfc5284747e737af0d1a25e64afdd47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" /> has <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vertex\" title=\"Vertex\">vertex</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff947434e8d911cc2c48214043c07d950858857d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4784770a0fbab87568fd865d911b4f472ddb1893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c8912c8c77da38f911af5dad85ebdcec8dd731dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/8789a47cdd80a8b6cf8cbd9b7ce6e9c9daca04ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A) } -p \\qquad \\text {(B) } 0 \\qquad \\text {(C) } 2 \\qquad \\text {(D) } 4 \\qquad \\text {(E) } p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4784770a0fbab87568fd865d911b4f472ddb1893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/7660845079668ec4eae411dce3f39a2a582353ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -p = a(0)^2 + b(0) + c = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"19\" />, so our parabola is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fcc9629cdc5b0fc8c93b281d8865e6d35682b562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = ax^2 + bx - p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>The x-coordinate of the vertex of a parabola is given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424644d3173e6f8d4cfb978c3d8e8fc1bbb3ce39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = p = \\frac{-b}{2a} \\Longleftrightarrow a = \\frac{-b}{2p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"195\" height=\"41\" />. Additionally, substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff947434e8d911cc2c48214043c07d950858857d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/767362eb6472cc8d00c0cec1e27a409109c6b394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = p = a(p)^2 + b(p) - p \\Longleftrightarrow ap^2 + (b-2)p = \\left(\\frac{-b}{2p}\\right)p^2 + (b-2)p = p\\left(\\frac b2-2\\right) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"667\" height=\"43\" />. Since it is given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11e370369929d0c50bb247338e91eb7534b305ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e795cdf07a66d22aa053d74c19b6ea71a9317877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{2} = 2 \\Longrightarrow b = 4\\ \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"159\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A parabola with the given equation and with vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff947434e8d911cc2c48214043c07d950858857d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> must have equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3c90bcc212c044e77ad8563e4a78c609b3f4599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=a(x-p)^2+p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" />. Because the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4784770a0fbab87568fd865d911b4f472ddb1893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c8912c8c77da38f911af5dad85ebdcec8dd731dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e37cf2ee84a1937b8aa43111beb093a0897ca84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-2/p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />. Thus<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c348426a836de2ab7299ad1596ec81a24afbf84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=-\\frac{2}{p}(x^2-2px+p^2)+p=-\\frac{2}{p}x^2+4x-p,\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"40\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe0b8c03563be1aa2db6f0c86a7ff4216a2f000a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b=4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B\">2006 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155957\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 214/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4440/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.001      1 -total\n 57.26%    7.444      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 41.01%    5.332      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2323:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017155957 and revision id 237144. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}